sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as NoahsArk Console
  participant API as Linux Node API
  participant Job as Job/Lease Store
  participant Agent as Windows Node Agent
  participant Lst as lstest Runner
  participant Dev as Device
  participant Ev as Evidence Store
  participant Gate as Completion Gate
  UI->>API: 创建执行任务（plan/profile/device）
  API->>Job: 入队 job + node/device lease
  Agent->>API: 心跳 + 能力声明
  Agent->>API: 长轮询 next job
  API-->>Agent: job + 签名下载地址
  Agent->>API: claim(job, idempotency_key)
  Agent->>API: 下载 profile / script / runner
  API-->>Agent: 文件 + SHA256
  Agent->>Agent: 校验哈希、工具链、工作目录
  Agent->>Dev: 预检串口/声卡/电源端点
  Agent->>API: 上传预检证据
  alt 预检失败
    API-->>Agent: BLOCKED_HUMAN
    Agent->>API: release lease + 清理
  else 预检通过
    API-->>Agent: run_profile 命令
    Agent->>Lst: 在 Windows Job Object 中启动
    Lst->>Dev: 执行真实测试
    Lst-->>Agent: stdout/stderr、音频、结果表
    Agent->>API: 心跳 + 取消轮询
    Agent->>Ev: 分块上传证据 + manifest
    Agent->>API: 签名回执
    API->>Gate: 回执 + 证据引用
    Gate-->>API: 完成门禁结果
    API-->>Agent: ack
    Agent->>Agent: 释放租约、清理工作目录
  end
  Note over Agent,API: 只有 Windows 节点出站 443；Linux 不远程执行设备脚本
